Subject: [PATCH 061/954] feat(dt-bindings): describe GPIO banks and config

Describe GPIO banks configs so that it can be used in
a device-tree file.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 604fc7613bffeb79a94b38f4a7403a1ea6978edf feat(dt-bindings): describe GPIO banks and config]
Signed-off-by: Pascal Paillet <p.paillet@st.com>
